sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant HTTP as Caikit HTTP Server<br/>8080/TCP
    participant GRPC as Caikit gRPC Server<br/>8085/TCP
    participant Runtime as Caikit Runtime
    participant LocalMod as Local Module<br/>(PeftPromptTuning /<br/>TextGeneration)
    participant EmbedMod as EmbeddingModule<br/>(sentence-transformers)
    participant TGISClient as TGISGenerationClient<br/>(gRPC)
    participant TGIS as TGIS Backend<br/>configurable/TCP gRPC
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TorchDist as torch.distributed<br/>29550/TCP

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,LocalMod: Flow 1: Local Text Generation Inference
        Client->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/task/text-generation<br/>HTTP (TLS configurable)
        HTTP->>Runtime: Dispatch to module
        Runtime->>LocalMod: PeftPromptTuning.run()<br/>in-process Python call
        LocalMod->>LocalMod: PyTorch model.generate()
        LocalMod-->>Runtime: Generated text
        Runtime-->>HTTP: Response
        HTTP-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,TGIS: Flow 2: Remote Text Generation via TGIS
        Client->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/task/text-generation<br/>HTTP or gRPC (configurable)
        HTTP->>Runtime: Dispatch to module
        Runtime->>TGISClient: TextGenerationTGIS.run()<br/>in-process
        TGISClient->>TGIS: Generate RPC<br/>gRPC, TLS optional mTLS
        TGIS-->>TGISClient: Generation result<br/>gRPC response
        TGISClient-->>Runtime: Mapped result
        Runtime-->>HTTP: Response
        HTTP-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,EmbedMod: Flow 3: Text Embedding Inference
        Client->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/task/embedding<br/>HTTP or gRPC (configurable)
        HTTP->>Runtime: Dispatch to module
        Runtime->>EmbedMod: EmbeddingModule.run_embedding()<br/>in-process
        EmbedMod->>EmbedMod: SentenceTransformer.encode()<br/>PyTorch inference
        EmbedMod-->>Runtime: Embedding vectors
        Runtime-->>HTTP: Response
        HTTP-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,TorchDist: Flow 4: Prompt Tuning Training
        Client->>GRPC: Training request<br/>gRPC 8085/TCP (configurable)
        GRPC->>Runtime: Dispatch to train
        Runtime->>LocalMod: PeftPromptTuning.train()<br/>in-process
        LocalMod->>HFHub: Download base model<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>(if ALLOW_DOWNLOADS=1)
        HFHub-->>LocalMod: Model artifacts
        LocalMod->>TorchDist: Multi-GPU coordination<br/>TCP/29550 (no encryption)
        LocalMod->>LocalMod: PyTorch training loop<br/>CUDA compute
        LocalMod-->>Runtime: Trained model saved
        Runtime-->>GRPC: Training complete
        GRPC-->>Client: gRPC Response
    end
